# cron_clock — the VAULT master tick
#
# {Monday..Sunday}'s {Noon, Dawn, Dusk} & {Yan, Tan, Tethera, Methera, Pits, Sethera, Azer}
# 7 days x 10 named spans = 70 addresses. One shape, all seven days.
#
# A lieutenant runs 480 minutes; a grotesque runs 204 minutes. Each line is
# a START TIME. Ends are start + length, so they are not written down again.
#
# Weekday names are preferable over digits: Sunday can be counted 0 and 7 in cron.
# Field 3 stays * on every line — cron ORs day-of-month against day-of-week.
#
#  m    h  dom mon  dow    address

# --- Monday ----------------------------------------------------
   0    0   *   *  MON    Monday's Dawn
   1    0   *   *  MON    Monday's Yan
  27    3   *   *  MON    Monday's Tan
  53    6   *   *  MON    Monday's Tethera
   0    8   *   *  MON    Monday's Noon
  18   10   *   *  MON    Monday's Methera
  43   13   *   *  MON    Monday's Pits
   0   16   *   *  MON    Monday's Dusk
   9   17   *   *  MON    Monday's Sethera
  35   20   *   *  MON    Monday's Azer

